  "summary": {
    "kind": "quote",
    "span": {
      "end": 1770,
      "end_line": 22,
      "line": 22,
      "start": 1287
    },
    "text": "An **org bundle** is a directory an organization publishes so that every Delphi install in that organization starts from the same knowledge, the same working skills and agents, and the same stated goals and perspective. The operator's intent (2026-10-25): Delphi accelerates humans working in a specific collaborative environment, and the critical chore is a **standard** by which an organization's knowledge and skills are bundled, defined as a plugin, and worked against by a team."
  }
